<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Soul Shift</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 50
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast soul shift &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Viva piort' and opens a portal from soul to soul: the 
caster and the target swap places, wherever in the world the target is. 
The target glows scarlet, the caster purple, and with a flash and a whoosh 
of air each stands where the other stood.
</p><p>It is a monster spell: no guild teaches it, and it isn't found among 
random treasure. If the spell fails, nothing happens.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Transport</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>